OL,3,GNEWSATributes paid to 19-year-olds
OL,4,Akilled in crash
OL,5,
OL,6,FTributes have been paid by the families
OL,7,Fof two 19-year-olds who died in a fatal
OL,8,Fcrash in Surrey.
OL,10,FEmergency services responded to a
OL,11,Fthree-car collision in Epsom Road, East
OL,12,FClandon, late on 21 August and Surrey
OL,13,FPolice said three people had been
OL,14,Farrested on suspicion of causing death
OL,15,Fby dangerous driving.
OL,17,FThe family of Joshua Farris, from
OL,18,FWoking, says he will be "deeply missed
OL,19,Fevery day, but he will never be
OL,20,Fforgotten".
OL,23,APub: 07-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
